# USDA FoodData Central API key, used for food search.
#
# The app falls back to the shared DEMO_KEY, which is rate limited to about
# 30 requests per hour. Get a free key in under a minute at:
#   https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below.
USDA_API_KEY=
